<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>构图图例库 · 从关系到画法</title>
<style>
/* Shared offline theme. No remote fonts, images, or runtime style dependencies. */
:root {
  color-scheme: light;
  --ink: #1e334b;
  --heading: #213f59;
  --muted: #63758a;
  --paper: #f3f6fa;
  --line: #dfe7ef;
  --green: #128575;
  --blue: #2563a6;
  --soft: #edf5fd;
  --surface: #ffffff;
  --shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(27, 61, 91, .02);
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-padding-top: 20px; }
body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font: 14px/1.6 -apple-system, system-ui, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; }
button, input, select { font: inherit; color: inherit; }
button, a { touch-action: manipulation; }
button { cursor: pointer; }
button:disabled { opacity: .45; cursor: default; }
a { color: var(--blue); text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
a:hover { color: #174d86; }
button:focus-visible, a:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, summary:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #78addd; outline-offset: 3px; }
[hidden] { display: none !important; }
header { background: #14324e; color: #fff; border-bottom: 3px solid #128575; padding: 25px 30px 0; }
.headerline { max-width: 1360px; margin: auto; display: flex; gap: 34px; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
.eyebrow { font-size: 10px; color: #b5cada; letter-spacing: 1.35px; }
h1 { margin: 6px 0 9px; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.4px; }
.intro { max-width: 770px; margin: 0; color: #d3e0ec; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }
.intro a { color: #fff; text-decoration-color: #a8c3d9; }
.stats { display: flex; gap: 0; flex-shrink: 0; background: #fff; color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid #e3eaf1; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); padding: 13px 5px; }
.stat { padding: 0 17px; min-width: 90px; }
.stat + .stat { border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
.stat b { display: block; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 600; color: #213f59; }
.stat span { display: block; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 5px; white-space: nowrap; }
.topnav { max-width: 1360px; margin: 22px auto 0; display: flex; gap: 5px; overflow: auto; }
.navbtn { border: 0; border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0; background: transparent; color: #c5d7e7; white-space: nowrap; padding: 10px 17px; font-size: 13px; }
.navbtn:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .08); color: #fff; }
.navbtn.active, .navbtn.active:hover { background: var(--paper); color: var(--heading); font-weight: 600; }
.shell { max-width: 1420px; margin: auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 218px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 22px; padding: 22px 30px 70px; }
main { min-width: 0; }
.sidebar { position: sticky; top: 18px; align-self: start; max-height: calc(100vh - 36px); overflow: auto; scrollbar-width: thin; }
.sidebar > details { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 14px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
.sidebar summary { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; color: var(--heading); }
.filter-label { display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; margin: 12px 0 4px; color: #415973; }
input[type=search], select { width: 100%; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #d6e0ea; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 11px; font-size: 12px; min-height: 36px; }
input[type=search]::placeholder { color: #8795a5; }
input[type=search]:focus, select:focus { border-color: #7aabd7; }
.subnote { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin: 9px 0; }
.sidegroup { margin-top: 15px; padding-top: 4px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
.sidegroup .subnote { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.7; }
.side-links { padding: 7px 13px 0; }
.side-links a { display: block; margin: 8px 0; font-size: 12px; }
.primary, .secondary, .pill, .load-more, .image-retry, .original-image-button { border: 1px solid #d6e0ea; border-radius: 6px; background: #fff; color: var(--heading); padding: 8px 13px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; text-decoration: none; }
.primary { color: #fff; border-color: var(--blue); background: var(--blue); }
.primary:hover { background: #1e578f; border-color: #1e578f; }
.secondary:hover, .pill:hover, .image-retry:hover, .original-image-button:hover { background: var(--soft); border-color: #b4cce3; color: #174d86; }
.wide { width: 100%; margin-top: 9px; }
.section-title { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 600; color: var(--heading); margin: 0 0 6px; letter-spacing: 0; }
.section-intro { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 13px; max-width: 970px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; }
.explorer { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 17px 16px 14px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); margin-bottom: 18px; }
.chooser { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px; }
.choice { text-align: left; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 9px 10px; min-height: 0; transition: border-color .12s, background .12s; }
.choice:hover { border-color: #8eb6d9; background: #f8fbff; }
.choice.active { border-color: var(--blue); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--blue); background: #edf5fd; }
.choice strong { display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5; }
.choice .question { display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 1; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--muted); margin: 3px 0; }
.choice small { display: block; font-size: 10px; color: #668096; line-height: 1.5; }
.skeleton { display: block; width: 100%; height: 60px; margin: 0 0 8px; color: #2563a6; }
.skeleton g { fill: #edf5fd; }
.choice .skeleton { height: 38px; max-width: 80px; margin: 0 0 5px; }
.aside-note { border-left: 3px solid var(--green); border-radius: 0 5px 5px 0; background: #f0f7f7; color: #526e7b; padding: 9px 12px; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.7; }
.tour-tabs { display: flex; gap: 7px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 0 15px; }
.pill { border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 11px; background: #fff; }
.pill.active { color: var(--blue); background: #eaf3fc; border-color: #a9c9e7; font-weight: 600; }
.tour-head { background: #f2f7fc; border: 1px solid #dce8f3; padding: 15px 17px; border-radius: 7px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
.tour-head h3 { color: var(--heading); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 6px; font-weight: 600; }
.tour-head p { color: #526b80; margin: 6px 0; font-size: 13px; }
.tour-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
.tour-card { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; background: #fff; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
.tour-card .body { padding: 14px; }
.tour-card h4 { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 600; color: var(--heading); margin: 0 0 8px; }
.tour-card p { font-size: 12px; color: #5f7389; margin: 6px 0; }
.tour-card .secondary { margin-top: 12px; }
.tour-bottom { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 13px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 16px; }
.toolbar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.result-line { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin: 11px 0 15px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
.result-line select { width: auto; min-height: 32px; padding: 5px 9px; margin-left: 6px; background: #fff; }
.active-filters { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 12px; }
.active-filters:empty { display: none; }
.filterchip { background: #edf5fd; color: #285f92; border: 1px solid #d4e4f3; border-radius: 5px; padding: 4px 8px; font-size: 11px; }
.filterchip:hover { background: #e1eefb; }
.result-guide { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
/* JS sets row spans after measuring each card, preserving source / keyboard order. */
.grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); grid-auto-rows: 8px; grid-auto-flow: row; align-items: start; gap: 16px; }
.card { min-width: 0; align-self: start; height: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
.card:hover { border-color: #bdcfdf; box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(27, 61, 91, .06); }
.thumb { display: block; position: relative; width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: auto; margin: 0; padding: 12px; border: 0; background: #fff; text-align: center; overflow: hidden; }
.thumb:hover { background: #f8fbfe; }
.thumb img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 360px; object-fit: contain; margin: 0 auto; }
.kind { position: absolute; bottom: 6px; right: 7px; border: 1px solid #dfe7ef; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .96); padding: 1px 5px; color: #718398; font-size: 10px; }
.cardbody { padding: 12px 14px 14px; flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.cardmeta { font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.6; color: #74869a; margin: 0 0 6px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.card h2 { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 600; color: var(--heading); margin: 0 0 7px; }
.titlebutton { border: 0; background: transparent; padding: 0; font: inherit; text-align: left; color: inherit; }
.titlebutton:hover { color: var(--blue); }
.recipe { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; color: #61768b; margin: 6px 0; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 3; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden; }
.tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; margin-top: 9px; }
.tag { background: #edf5fd; border: 1px solid #dce9f6; color: #396b99; border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 6px; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.7; }
.tag.layout { background: #f2f6f8; border-color: #e2eaf0; color: #657b90; }
.local-open { font-size: 11px; margin-top: 11px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.cardfoot { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px; border-top: 1px solid #edf1f6; padding: 9px 12px; font-size: 11px; background: #fff; }
.access { color: #708398; max-width: 60%; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
.iconbtn { border: 0; background: transparent; color: #8396a9; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1; padding: 1px 4px; }
.iconbtn.on { color: #b48125; }
.comparecheck { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 3px; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; color: #60778e; }
input[type=checkbox] { accent-color: var(--blue); }
.empty { border: 1px dashed #c1d1e0; border-radius: 8px; background: #fff; padding: 40px 20px; color: var(--muted); text-align: center; }
.load-status { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; padding: 22px 10px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; text-align: center; min-height: 68px; }
.load-status p { margin: 0; }
.load-more { color: var(--blue); border-color: #b6cfe7; padding: 8px 20px; background: #fff; }
.load-more:hover { background: #edf5fd; border-color: #83acd2; }
.load-sentinel { height: 1px; width: 100%; }
.image-loading { background-color: #f2f6fa; }
.thumb.image-loading { min-height: 130px; }
.image-loading img, img.image-loading { opacity: .35; }
.image-error { min-height: 110px; background: #f7f9fc; color: #6c7d91; }
.thumb.image-error { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 9px; }
.image-error img { display: none; }
.image-error p { font-size: 12px; margin: 4px 0; }
.image-retry { font-size: 11px; padding: 5px 11px; }
.detail-loading { min-height: 240px; background: #f5f8fc; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 9px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
.original-image-button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--blue); border-color: #b8d0e5; background: #f5f9fe; }
.about { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 16px; font-size: 12px; color: #65798d; }
.about summary { cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--heading); }
.about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 23px; }
.about h3 { font-size: 14px; color: var(--heading); margin-bottom: 8px; }
.about ol, .about ul { padding-left: 20px; }
.about li { margin: 6px 0; }
.comparebar { position: fixed; bottom: 16px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); z-index: 8; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 11px 16px; background: #14324e; color: #fff; border: 1px solid #274e70; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(20, 50, 78, .2); font-size: 12px; }
.comparebar .primary { background: #2563a6; border-color: #4e85bc; }
.comparebar .secondary { background: transparent; color: #e6eef6; border-color: #658099; }
.modal { display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; overflow: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; background: rgba(13, 32, 51, .77); padding: 24px; z-index: 20; }
.modal.open { display: block; }
.dialog { max-width: 1390px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #dce6f0; border-radius: 9px; padding: 26px; box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(13, 32, 51, .2); }
.dialog h2 { font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.45; font-weight: 600; color: var(--heading); margin: 12px 38px 18px 0; }
.dialog h3 { color: var(--heading); font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; margin-top: 24px; }
.close { position: absolute; top: 10px; right: 12px; border: 0; border-radius: 5px; background: #fff; color: #5c758e; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1; width: 34px; height: 34px; }
.close:hover { background: #edf3f9; }
.detail-nav { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; padding-right: 30px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.detail-top { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(280px, 1fr); gap: 25px; }
.detail-top > div { min-width: 0; }
.large-img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 680px; object-fit: contain; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 5px; background: #f9fbfd; }
.detailtext dl { margin-top: 0; }
.detailtext dt, .compare-item dt { font-weight: 600; color: #37546f; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 15px; }
.detailtext dt:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
.detailtext dd, .compare-item dd { font-size: 13px; color: #60768b; margin: 4px 0; line-height: 1.75; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.recipe-box { padding: 12px 15px; margin: 10px 0; background: #f0f7f7; border-left: 3px solid var(--green); border-radius: 0 5px 5px 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; color: #4c697b; }
.recipe-box b { display: block; color: #30576b; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.detailsource { margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: #74869a; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.9; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.detaillinks { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px 13px; margin: 14px 0; font-size: 12px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.compare-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.compare-item { min-width: 0; }
.compare-item h3 { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 8px 0 12px; }
.compare-item img { width: 100%; height: 260px; object-fit: contain; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 5px; background: #fff; }
.related-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin-top: 12px; }
.related-card { text-align: left; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; background: #f8fbfe; padding: 11px; min-width: 0; }
.related-card:hover { border-color: #a9c9e7; background: #f1f7fd; }
.related-card img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 150px; object-fit: contain; }
.related-card strong { display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--heading); margin-top: 8px; }
.related-card small { font-size: 11px; color: #74869a; }
.status { position: fixed; top: 18px; right: 18px; z-index: 30; background: #1e526f; color: #fff; padding: 10px 16px; border: 1px solid #3f728b; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(20, 50, 78, .12); font-size: 12px; }
.noimage { padding: 28px 12px; background: #f2f6fb; color: #698298; font-size: 12px; }
.noimage .skeleton { max-width: 180px; margin: 0 auto 12px; }
.noimage .subnote { font-size: 11px; }
.footerlinks { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.9; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 22px; }
.footerlinks a { margin-right: 12px; }
.footerlinks p { margin: 8px 0; }
#loadingNotice { color: #365a79; background: #eaf2fa !important; border-bottom: 1px solid #cfdeed; font-size: 13px; }
@media (min-width: 1600px) {
  .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
}
@media (max-width: 1200px) {
  header { padding-right: 24px; padding-left: 24px; }
  .headerline { gap: 22px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .stats { padding: 11px 3px; }
  .stat { padding: 0 12px; min-width: 75px; }
  .stat b { font-size: 22px; }
  .stat span { font-size: 10px; }
  .shell { padding-right: 24px; padding-left: 24px; grid-template-columns: 205px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
  .chooser { grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px; }
  .choice { padding: 8px; }
  .choice .question { display: none; }
  .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .tour-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .tour-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .tour-card .thumb { min-height: 160px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .tour-card .thumb img { max-height: 260px; }
  .detail-top { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .compare-item img { height: 210px; }
}
@media (max-width: 960px) {
  .headerline { gap: 20px; }
  h1 { font-size: 27px; }
  .intro { font-size: 12px; }
  .stats { padding: 11px 0; }
  .stat { padding: 0 9px; min-width: 65px; }
  .stat span { white-space: normal; max-width: 62px; }
  .chooser { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .choice .question { display: -webkit-box; }
  .compare-grid { gap: 14px; }
}
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  header { padding: 20px 18px 0; }
  .headerline { display: block; }
  h1 { font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: -.3px; }
  .intro { line-height: 1.65; }
  .stats { margin-top: 16px; padding: 10px 0; width: fit-content; max-width: 100%; }
  .stat { padding: 0 15px; min-width: 85px; }
  .stat b { font-size: 21px; }
  .stat span { white-space: nowrap; max-width: none; font-size: 10px; }
  .topnav { margin-top: 18px; }
  .navbtn { padding: 9px 12px; font-size: 12px; }
  .shell { display: block; padding: 16px 14px 70px; }
  .sidebar { position: static; max-height: none; margin-bottom: 16px; overflow: visible; }
  .sidebar > details { padding: 12px 13px; }
  .filter-controls { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0 12px; }
  .filter-controls > div:first-child, .sidebar .sidegroup { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .side-links { display: none; }
  .sidegroup .subnote { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .explorer { padding: 14px 12px 12px; }
  .section-title { font-size: 17px; }
  .section-intro { font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .chooser { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px; }
  .choice { padding: 8px 9px; }
  .choice .question { display: none; }
  .choice .skeleton { height: 30px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .aside-note { font-size: 11px; padding: 8px 10px; }
  .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .cardbody { padding: 13px 15px 15px; }
  .card h2 { font-size: 15px; }
  .recipe { font-size: 12px; }
  .tag { font-size: 11px; }
  .thumb { padding: 13px; }
  .thumb img { max-height: 420px; }
  .tour-card { display: block; }
  .tour-card .thumb { display: block; min-height: 0; }
  .tour-card .thumb img { max-height: 340px; }
  .tour-head { padding: 12px 14px; }
  .tour-head h3 { font-size: 16px; }
  .tour-head p { font-size: 12px; }
  .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
  .result-line { gap: 8px; }
  .result-line select { max-width: 190px; }
  .modal { padding: 10px; }
  .dialog { padding: 20px 15px; border-radius: 8px; }
  .dialog h2 { font-size: 20px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .detail-nav { gap: 7px; padding-right: 26px; font-size: 11px; }
  .detail-nav .secondary { padding: 6px 10px; font-size: 11px; }
  .detail-top { gap: 16px; }
  .large-img { max-height: 68vh; }
  .detailtext dt { margin-top: 13px; }
  .compare-grid, .related-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .compare-item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom: 15px; }
  .compare-item:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .compare-item img { height: auto; max-height: 350px; }
  .related-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr; column-gap: 12px; }
  .related-card img { height: 85px; grid-row: 1 / 3; }
  .related-card .noimage { grid-row: 1 / 3; padding: 9px 5px; }
  .related-card strong { margin-top: 3px; }
  .comparebar { width: calc(100% - 22px); justify-content: space-between; gap: 7px; padding: 10px 12px; }
  .comparebar .primary, .comparebar .secondary { font-size: 11px; padding: 7px 11px; }
  .status { left: 14px; right: 14px; top: 14px; width: fit-content; max-width: calc(100% - 28px); }
  .detail-loading { min-height: 180px; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after { scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition: none !important; animation: none !important; }
}
@media print {
  .sidebar, .topnav, .toolbar, .comparebar, .actions, #explorer, .active-filters, .load-status, .load-more { display: none !important; }
  header { background: #fff; border-bottom-color: #ccc; color: #000; padding: 10px 0; }
  h1 { color: #000; }
  .intro { color: #444; }
  .stats { border: 0; box-shadow: none; }
  .shell { display: block; padding: 15px 0; }
  .grid { display: block; column-count: 2; column-gap: 16px; }
  .card { break-inside: avoid; margin-bottom: 16px; display: inline-flex; width: 100%; box-shadow: none; }
  .modal { position: static; padding: 0; background: #fff; }
  .dialog { border: 0; box-shadow: none; }
}

.image-frame{display:block;position:relative;min-width:0;overflow:hidden}.image-hint{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:12px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#74869a;pointer-events:none}.image-frame.image-error{min-height:120px}.image-error .image-hint{position:relative;min-height:120px}.image-frame.image-loading img{opacity:.35}@media(max-width:760px){.related-card>.image-frame{grid-row:1/3}}

</style></head><body>
<noscript><p style="padding:18px;background:#fff1d2">当前预览器不执行脚本。请打开 <a href="静态总览.html">静态总览</a> 或 <a href="分类地图.html">分类地图</a>。</p></noscript>
<div id="loadingNotice" style="padding:13px 4vw;background:#fff1d2">正在载入图库。如果列表未出现，可以直接打开 <a href="静态总览.html">无脚本静态总览</a>。</div>
<header><div class="headerline"><div><div class="eyebrow">COMPOSITION STUDY LIBRARY · 分类重审版</div><h1>先想清关系，再拓宽画法。</h1><p class="intro">从“我想说清什么”找图，从不同空间骨架获得新想法。保留原图、来源与本地文件，把复合图拆成可以学习的组织方式。</p></div><div class="stats" id="stats"></div></div>
<nav class="topnav" id="views" aria-label="浏览路径"><button class="navbtn active" data-view="purpose">① 按表达目的</button><button class="navbtn" data-view="layout">② 按空间骨架</button><button class="navbtn" data-view="tours">③ 同题换画法</button><button class="navbtn" data-view="compound">复合图拆解</button><button class="navbtn" data-view="browse">全部素材</button></nav></header>
<div class="shell"><aside class="sidebar"><details open><summary>筛选与检索</summary><div class="filter-controls">
<div><label class="filter-label" for="search">关键词 / 图例编号</label><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="如：共享、客户、K002"></div>
<div><label class="filter-label" for="task">想说清什么</label><select id="task"></select></div>
<div><label class="filter-label" for="layout">空间骨架</label><select id="layout"></select></div>
<div><label class="filter-label" for="context">应用领域</label><select id="context"></select></div>
<div><label class="filter-label" for="role">材料角色</label><select id="role"><option value="diagrams">图例与画布 · 隐藏套装</option><option value="all">全部角色 · 含套装</option><option value="single">单一关系图</option><option value="composite">复合关系图</option><option value="worksheet">工作画布</option><option value="pack">套装与资源包</option></select></div>
<div><label class="filter-label" for="access">本地文件</label><select id="access"><option value="all">全部格式</option><option value="editable">有可编辑文件</option><option value="ppt">有 PowerPoint 文件</option><option value="saved">有本地原文件</option><option value="reference">静态参考 / 无可编辑文件</option></select></div>
<div><label class="filter-label" for="batch">收录批次</label><select id="batch"></select></div>
<div id="publicationFilter" hidden><label class="filter-label" for="visibility">公开浏览范围</label><select id="visibility"><option value="allowed">本站有原图的素材</option><option value="all">全部来源 · 含仅链接条目</option></select></div>
<div class="sidegroup"><button class="secondary wide" id="reset">清空筛选 · 重新找图</button><button class="secondary wide" id="exportFav">导出我的收藏</button><p class="subnote">目的与骨架可交叉筛选。复合图有多个标签，分类计数不能相加当作素材总量。</p></div>
</div></details><div class="side-links"><a href="分类地图.html">查看完整分类地图</a><a href="静态总览.html">无脚本静态总览</a><a href="分类下载索引.html">打开本地原文件</a></div></aside>
<main><section id="explorer" class="explorer" aria-label="构图探索"></section>
<section id="catalog" aria-label="图例列表"><div class="toolbar" id="modes"><button class="pill active" data-mode="all">当前范围全部</button><button class="pill" data-mode="new">本轮新增</button><button class="pill" data-mode="featured">精选起步</button><button class="pill" data-mode="favorites">我的收藏</button><button class="pill" id="showPacks">单独看套装</button></div>
<div class="active-filters" id="activeFilters"></div><p class="result-guide" id="resultGuide"></p>
<div class="result-line"><span id="resultCount" aria-live="polite"></span><label for="sort">浏览顺序<select id="sort"><option value="diverse">轮换骨架 · 拓宽视野</option><option value="recommended">精选优先</option><option value="id">按编号</option></select></label></div>
<div class="grid" id="grid"></div><div class="load-sentinel" id="loadSentinel" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="load-status"><p id="loadStatus" aria-live="polite"></p><button class="load-more" id="loadMore" type="button">加载更多图例</button></div><div class="empty" id="empty" hidden><p>当前条件没有交集。可以去掉一个骨架、领域或文件条件。</p><button class="secondary" id="emptyReset">清空筛选</button></div></section>
<details class="about" id="classificationAbout"><summary>为什么重新分类？怎样避免分类反过来限制想象？</summary><div class="about-grid"><div><h3>把不同问题拆开问</h3><ol><li><b>表达关系：</b>图要让读者理解什么？一张图可以有多个关系。</li><li><b>空间骨架：</b>信息放在哪里？同一关系可以有多种画法。</li><li><b>应用领域：</b>架构、业务、理论是素材语境，不再与矩阵、循环混为同级类别。</li><li><b>材料角色：</b>单图、复合图、画布、套装分别浏览，避免用封面推断全部内容。</li></ol></div><div><h3>四个容易误读的地方</h3><ul><li>环形排布不一定表示循环，螺旋也可能只是阶段顺序。</li><li>中心加外围不一定是网络，也可能是分类或两层分解。</li><li>金字塔不一定表示数量，逐层高度也不自动代表成熟度。</li><li>矩阵是位置骨架；其中可以表达对应、责任、阶段或判断。</li></ul><p>这是本库的学习检索口径。分类依据当前所展示的预览；对套装的判断不外推到未查看页面。</p></div></div><div id="reviewSummary"></div><p><a href="分类重审说明.txt">查看重审说明与明确纠正记录</a></p></details>
<div class="footerlinks" id="footnote"></div></main></div>
<div class="comparebar" id="comparebar" hidden><span id="comparecount"></span><button class="primary" id="compareBtn">并排对照</button><button class="secondary" id="clearCompare">清空</button></div>
<div class="modal" id="modal"><section class="dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="dialogtitle"><button class="close" id="closeModal" aria-label="关闭详情">×</button><div id="dialogContent"></div></section></div><div class="status" id="toast" role="status" hidden></div>
